@baseUrl = http://localhost:5019
@applicationId = app-1001

### Synthetic identities and seeded applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo

### Create (fresh database; use the same key/body to retry)
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/pricing-exceptions
X-User-Id: rm-alex
Idempotency-Key: walkthrough-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"applicationId":"{{applicationId}}","discountBps":25,"reason":"Customer retention"}

### Capture the created id (VS Code REST Client)
@requestId = {{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Amend while pending
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/pricing-exceptions/{{requestId}}
X-User-Id: rm-alex
Content-Type: application/json

{"discountBps":40,"reason":"Corrected retention offer","expectedVersion":1}

### Stale approval: expect 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/pricing-exceptions/{{requestId}}/decisions
X-User-Id: reviewer-jules
Content-Type: application/json

{"outcome":"Approved","expectedVersion":1,"comment":"Old view"}

### Approve current revision
POST {{baseUrl}}/pricing-exceptions/{{requestId}}/decisions
X-User-Id: reviewer-jules
Content-Type: application/json

{"outcome":"Approved","expectedVersion":2,"comment":"Reviewed revised terms"}

### Downstream approved terms and provenance
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/approved-discount
X-User-Id: mortgage-process

### Current status, every revision and terminal decision
GET {{baseUrl}}/pricing-exceptions/{{requestId}}
X-User-Id: rm-alex
